cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FieldScribe, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "FieldScribe: Field sample metadata, made easy"
abstract: >-
  A mobile-first, offline-capable web app for capturing biological and
  environmental sample metadata in the field and exporting it in the format each
  downstream database expects (ERGA / DToL and BGE PopGenomics manifests, BOLD /
  iBOL, and ENA GSC MIxS). Built for the SciLifeLab Planetary Biology Strategic
  Area (Uppsala University) in collaboration with ERGA and BGE/BGE+.
type: software
